  Non-uniform density solution
  >> Stop light:\
\>", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"8980d36e-c63f-4045-aa26-51bc57465701"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{" ", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Remove", "[", "\"\<Global`*\>\"", " ", "]"}], ";"}], 
