Cell["\<\
The above graph illustrates that the high density region migrates backwards \
in time and the low density region migrates forward in time.  Therefore the \
interval between cars which have stopped and those which have reached maximum \
speed widens with time.  \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"51ca7e1b-e9a9-4c67-8431-ad087a0f395c"],

